<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on LIFFE BPT-Future.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on LIFFE BPT-Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued four million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the LIFFE BPT-Future, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	    ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	  127.00 PCT	3.98 DEM</p>
<p> PUT B	   127.00 PCT	3.59 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C	  130.00 PCT	2.59 DEM</p>
<p> PUT D	   123.00 PCT	2.05 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.DEC.96-20.AUG.97   PAYDATE	02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
